# 09b round-8 distinguishing ablations of clean payload C8

Payload C8: 79151afc77533d5d542918515d8809773ff61809.
Each ablation changes exactly one behaviour in a detached worktree at C8, runs
packages/kernel/tests/*.test.ts against it, and is reverted before the next.
An ablation is REJECTED when named packet cases fail; that is what makes those cases
distinguishing rather than merely green.

X1-X7 are new for the two round-6-review findings and the self-found defects found with them.
S1/S2/V3/N1/N3/P1/JCS re-prove representative prior guards after the reconstruction.

