=== ablation [JCS]: JSON.stringify substituted for the approved JCS substrate (K11-R1-JCS-01) ===
packages/kernel/src/values.ts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)
    193 tests, 12 failing -> REJECTED by 8 case(s):
